  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Hana. You're verified, and I've checked your order.\n\nOur courier records show the order was left at your door at 7:02 PM. The courier took a photo of a bag at the door of apartment 1204. Because of that photo, I can't issue a refund or credit myself.\n\nI've passed your case to a human specialist to review as a delivery dispute. They'll follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nIn the meantime, you could check with neighbors or the building's front desk, in case the bag was moved."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, the photo shows a bag at my door? I checked at 7:10 and there was nothing there. And honestly, packages go missing in my building all the time, so this doesn't surprise me. I'm not waiting a day for someone to review it, I want my money back for the order (7501) today."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand the frustration, Hana, especially if the food went missing after delivery. That is a real problem for you. Even so, I can't refund the order myself. The courier's records include a photo of the bag at your door. When that photo exists and the order is disputed, policy requires a specialist to review it. I'm not able to override that or issue a refund today.\n\nThis is what I've done:\n- I've escalated your case (reference ESC-700), and it includes what you told me. You checked at 7:10 PM and found nothing, and packages often go missing in your building.\n- A specialist will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise the outcome.\n\nIf you want, you can also ask your building management whether they have door or hallway camera footage from around 7:02 PM. A specialist may find that useful."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I get that there's a process, but I'm still not happy about it. So I've got to wait a whole day with no food and no money back? My pizza was supposed to be here at 7, and I'm stuck with this.\n\nFine, I'll take the reference number ESC-700. If the specialist doesn't get back to me within 24 hours, I'm going to be really annoyed. And please make sure they know I checked my door at 7:10 and there was nothing there."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I know it's frustrating to be left without dinner and without a refund tonight, Hana. I'm sorry I can't resolve it faster.\n\nYour reference number is **ESC-700**. The specialist's notes include that you checked your door at 7:10 PM and found nothing there. They also say packages often go missing in your building. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  }
